ne another, through coded poems and songs, accepting &quot;heresies&quot; more easily (the Jews were better treated here, before the creation of the very first Inquisition). Overall, the fall of a more open-minded society of Kindred (and possibly Werewolves) to the hands of Frankish Vampires and Pures could be interesting.<br /> <br /> Or the colonization of Indochina by the French. Here, we could have the various mages/Vampires/Werewolves etc. coming to term with very different civilizations with an history of resisting oppression by a powerful nation (China). Something about the War of Secession could also be quite interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","user":"Ur-Than","date":". 01-12-2016, 09:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1233-ur-than","name":"Ur-Than","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T17:37:34-08:00","id":807450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yaoi Huntress Earth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/804492-eras-of-darkness-any-historical-setting-you-would-like-to-explore?p=806331#post806331\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they continued the Victorian Era line, focusing on Changeling and Wraith would be nice since fairies and spiritualism was an in thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Was about to say this since it is 