07:00","id":852875,"title":"","content":"I would really like to see Vampire, Inquisitor/Hunter and Devil's Due books set in the period of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thirty_Years&#39;_War\" target=\"_blank\">30 Years War</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_Civil_War\" target=\"_blank\">English Civil War</a>. It would be fascinating to see where Vampire society came down on the divide between Catholic and Protestant, how the Inquisition reacted to the new religious divide, what Hunter groups formed among Protestant and Puritan communities and how the Earthbound were affected by the new era of renewed witch-hunts and religious fanaticism.<br /> <br /> It was sure to have been a critical time for all three communities. The colonization of the New World could also give us insight into how certain supernaturals took-root in the Americas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","user":"the_1990","date":". 03-25-2016, 06:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T20:15:40-07:00","id":856891,"title":"","content":"Civil War era Vampire or Werewolf<br /> WWI into WWII era Vampire or Werewolf<br /> <br /> As for Pirates... Rokea!<br /> <br /> And for fun/humor: Mokele set in post WWII Japan and how one inspires Godzilla.<br /> And for non realism: Steampunk or a 50's setting that is more 'B' movie then reality. <br /> <br /> Also Mad Max/post apocalyptic style would be fun (cyberpunk or shadow run)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/433-jasoncarrier","name":"JasonCarrier","avatar