ow is this era particularly tied to the Demons and their themes of Eschatonism and Faith?</div> </div> </div> </div>i know they werent/they were a few, no more than your fingers.<br /> <br /> but... mainly because of the lack of faith on that era and the horrors of war. i think the Nam era was a time of a downspiral on faith.. Which gives an interesting view from the demon point.<br /> Just imagine it, youre on a time in which your or your best friends were either fighting for peace, or fighting on one of the most bloody wars ever.<br /> The president (for the first time) was a sadistic bastard that was willing to Nuke a country to win.<br /> the peace movement was strong, but it was weak.<br /> civil rioting, military police in the streets. the death of the american dream.<br /> an era were soldiers were seen not as glorious man who fought evil (WWII) but as &quot;baby killers.&quot; and &quot;murders of bystanders.&quot;<br /> Where every single second there was fear and loathing.<br /> <br /> The perfect time to be a fallen angel.<br /> <br /> ((P.S: SORRY OF MY SPEECH OFFENDE ANYONE!, i was trying to showcase the steriotype of the era))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T02:25:02-07:00","id":872972,"title":"","content":"I really don't see it. And the Vietnam conflict was longer then